aperback-writer/#Personnel\" >Personnel</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/paperback-writer/#In_the_studio\" >In the studio</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/paperback-writer/2/#Promotional_films\" >Promotional films</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"#Chart_success\" >Chart success</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"#Top_Of_The_Pops_appearance\" >Top Of The Pops appearance</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"#Live_performances\" >Live performances</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Chart_success\"></span>Chart success<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>&#8216;Paperback Writer&#8217; was the first Beatles single since <a href=\"/songs/she-loves-you/\">&#8216;She Loves You&#8217;</a> not to debut at the top of the UK charts. Sales were the lowest for any release since <a href=\"/songs/love-me-do/\">&#8216;Love Me Do&#8217;</a>.</p><p>It did, however, reach number one, both in the band&#8217;s home country and in the United States, West Germany, Australia, New Zealand and Norway. In America it spent two weeks at the top of the <em>Billboard</em> Hot 100.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/paperback-writer/&quot;}' id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-224 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_paperback_writer/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/